        // `deploy`: the four ground stakes fire one after another (gpu_consts::stake).
        motion: (layer: Land, size: 2, speed: 22, accel: 16, turn: 70, deploy: 2.6),
        // The Paladin's gun made a siege howitzer (docs/STYLE.md "The electric bore"):
